 "s0096": "**Category leaders run large seasonal flights to strengthen their position.**",
 "s0097": "Enterol and Linex account for most category spend (**RUB 180M and 65M** respectively), concentrating activity in peak demand periods and securing a high share of voice",
 "s0098": "**More media support comes with higher brand sales.**",
 "s0099": "Linex’s National TV flight in Jan–Feb 2026 lifted sales **from RUB 387M to 470M (+21%)**, confirming that high-reach placements can stimulate demand",
 "s0100": "Acipol’s Sep–Nov 2023 flight lifted brand sales **from RUB 111M to 236M (×2)**, while its early-year flight (Feb–Apr 2023) had no noticeable positive effect on sales",
 "s0101": "Source: Mediascope, IQVIA. 2026 budget — Jan–Aug 2026 (sum of monthly data, OMD calculation). SOS — brand’s share of monthly spend",
 "s0102": "Monitoring shows the leaders rely mainly on high-reach National TV (Enterol and Linex in 2026, Acipol and Maxilac in 2025). Other competitors use OOH, radio and OLV",
