 "s0326": "Enterol and Bac-Set **lead in digital investment** (RUB 40.2M and 33.1M respectively), with the main focus on **Paid Search (51% and 84% of budget)**. In June both brands sharply increased media support to capture more existing demand",
 "s0327": "With a RUB 2.8M digital budget, Normobact **held sales at RUB 39–44M** early in the year. **The June dip to RUB 35.4M** came amid minimal activity and growing competitive pressure",
